# Optional: where autoheal posts a notice each time it restarts an unhealthy container. Copy to autoheal.env and
# restrict it (cp autoheal.env.example autoheal.env && chmod 600 autoheal.env); autoheal.env is gitignored and
# never committed: a webhook URL is a secret, since anyone who has it can post to the channel.
#
# A Discord channel webhook (Channel settings -> Integrations -> Webhooks) works as is. Leave it empty, or don't
# create autoheal.env at all, to only log restarts (docker compose logs autoheal, or Dozzle).
WEBHOOK_URL=
